Description: Python client for the Snipe-IT asset management API
 Typed Python client library for the Snipe-IT REST API: assets, models,
 categories, manufacturers, suppliers, locations, users, licenses,
 consumables, accessories, components and more. Built on httpx and
 pydantic.
 .
 Used by mcp-server-snipeit.
